From: junkyard
Subject: [PATCH] hdcp/samsung: port to Linux 6.18 (lynx)

Port private/google-modules/hdcp/samsung to the GrapheneOS Linux 6.18 GKI for the gs201 lynx build.
Mechanical API migrations, no intended behaviour change:

  - platform_driver.remove returns void (6.11)

Files: main.c

lynx-only (kernel/patches-lynx/): felix builds the 6.1 tree these
drivers were written for.
---
diff --git a/main.c b/main.c
index bbeffa2..34fa4f3 100644
--- a/main.c
+++ b/main.c
@@ -158,11 +158,10 @@ static int exynos_hdcp_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	return 0;
 }
 
-static int exynos_hdcp_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)
+static void exynos_hdcp_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)
 {
 	struct hdcp_device *hdcp_dev = platform_get_drvdata(pdev);
 	hdcp_auth_worker_deinit(hdcp_dev);
-	return 0;
 }
 
 static const struct of_device_id exynos_hdcp_of_match_table[] = {
